  <h1>About LastMinuteMovers</h1>
  <p>LastMinuteMovers is a small directory for a common problem: you need to move this weekend, and the truck you reserved is gone, cancelled, or never showed up on the lot.</p>
  <p>We are an independent website. We are not a truck rental company, a moving company, a booking marketplace, or a dispatcher. We do not rent trucks, send crews, or guarantee that a listed location has a vehicle today.</p>

  <h2>How listings get on this site</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every fact — hours, phone numbers, truck types, and service flags — must come from a real public source, usually the business’s own website or an official location page.</li>
    <li>Each listing includes the source URL and the date we last checked it.</li>
    <li>If we cannot verify a detail, we leave it out. We do not invent businesses, hours, truck types, or prices.</li>
    <li>“One-way” is flagged only when the location’s public page mentions one-way rentals.</li>
    <li>“Labor only” is flagged only when the source says the business will load or unload a truck, van, or container that the customer already has.</li>
    <li>“Weekend hours” is flagged only when Saturday or Sunday opening times are published. “Not published” is used when a day’s hours are missing; we do not invent “Closed.”</li>
    <li>We do not cache live truck inventory. Reservation links go to the company’s own page.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Hours and availability change, especially at month-end and on summer weekends. Confirm with the location before you travel or pay. Broader options — other rental brands, portable containers, and moving-day tips — are in the <a href="/guides/uhaul-sold-out-every-other-way-to-move-this-weekend/">sold-out weekend guide</a>.</p>

  <h2>Adding a city</h2>
  <p>Each city is one JSON file. The research checklist for a new city lives in the project’s <code>scripts/new-city.md</code> file, so a nightly pass can add one verified page at a time.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For corrections or questions, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.emailContact }}">{{ site.emailContact }}</a>. Truck rental locations and labor-only movers that want to be listed can use the <a href="/list-your-business/">list your business</a> page.</p>
